==============================================================================
F. Algorithmic theorem shape
==============================================================================
Endpoint-ultrafilter enumerator:
  1. Keep class reps and Aut(parent).
  2. Enumerate Aut(parent)-orbits in the incident Boolean cube.
  3. Attach deletion/filter trace: (deleted-card id, owner score/side).
  4. If trace bucket is pure, accept one representative without full child
     canonicalization; use canonical fallback only on mixed trace buckets.
  5. Cache H, c3, SCC, and OCF payloads at the same time.

Interpretation:
  The incident cube has literal ultrafilters.  The paired deletion trace is
  the address that makes much of that side choice descend through the
  isomorphism quotient.  This is HYP-2245 as an enumerator design rule.

